@abstract:
Kea is a unified monorepo for intelligent infrastructure orchestration,
investigation, signalling, and WebAssembly interface tooling. Each component
maps to a behavioural trait of the Kea parrot: strategic roosting (Bivouac),
vocal coordination (Call), investigative dexterity (Mandible), and adaptive
intelligence (Wit).
@end

;; === SESSION STARTUP CHECKLIST ===
;; 1. Read this file (you are here)
;; 2. Read .machine_readable/6a2/STATE.a2ml for current project state
;; 3. Read .machine_readable/6a2/META.a2ml for meta-information
;; 4. Read .machine_readable/6a2/ECOSYSTEM.a2ml for ecosystem position
;; 5. Read TOPOLOGY.md for architecture map and completion dashboard
;; 6. Read relevant subproject README.adoc before modifying code

;; === REPOSITORY STRUCTURE ===
;;
;; kea/                           (monorepo root — single .git)
;; ├── bivouac/                   Rust — orchestration and deployment controller
;; │   ├── src/                   Application source (config, error, playbook, main)
;; │   ├── tests/                 Integration tests
;; │   ├── playbooks/             TOML playbook definitions
;; │   ├── fuzz/                  Fuzz testing targets
;; │   └── Cargo.toml             Package manifest
;; ├── call/                      Protocol definitions (Cap'n Proto, MCP)
;; │   └── README.adoc            Request-Signal-Action protocol spec
;; ├── mandible/                  Rust workspace — sensor suite
;; │   ├── crates/kea-beak/       Filesystem/network auditor (10k files/sec)
;; │   ├── crates/kea-mandible/   CLI orchestrator for sensors
;; │   ├── crates/wp-praxis/      WordPress core auditor
;; │   ├── crates/slop-gate/      Bloat detection and filtering
;; │   └── Cargo.toml             Workspace manifest
;; ├── wit/                       WIT interface definitions (Component Model)
;; │   └── ROADMAP.adoc           Phase 0-3 specification roadmap
;; ├── .github/workflows/         17 RSR-standard CI/CD workflows
;; ├── .machine_readable/6a2/     Machine-readable state (A2ML format)
;; ├── .well-known/               Security and AI discovery files
;; └── TOPOLOGY.md                Architecture map and completion dashboard

;; === CANONICAL LOCATIONS ===
;; Machine-readable state: .machine_readable/6a2/ ONLY (never root)
;; Documentation: README.adoc, TOPOLOGY.md, subproject README.adoc files
;; Rust source: bivouac/src/, mandible/crates/*/src/
;; Tests: bivouac/tests/, mandible/crates/*/tests/
;; Fuzz targets: bivouac/fuzz/, mandible/fuzz/
;; Playbooks: bivouac/playbooks/
;; Protocol specs: call/
;; WIT definitions: wit/
;; CI/CD: .github/workflows/ (root only — no subproject workflows)

;; === CRITICAL INVARIANTS ===
;; - This is a MONOREPO: single .git root, no .git dirs in subprojects
;; - No .github/ directories in subprojects (all CI/CD at root)
;; - SPDX headers on ALL files (PMPL-1.0-or-later)
;; - No believe_me, assert_total, sorry, Admitted, unsafeCoerce, Obj.magic
;; - SCM/A2ML files ONLY in .machine_readable/6a2/ (never root, never subprojects)
;; - Author: Jonathan D.A. Jewell <j.d.a.jewell@open.ac.uk>
;; - Git email: 6759885+hyperpolymath@users.noreply.github.com
;; - License: PMPL-1.0-or-later (MPL-2.0 in root LICENSE for tooling compat)
;; - No TypeScript, Python, Go, Node.js, npm, Bun
;; - Containers: Chainguard base, Containerfile (not Dockerfile), Podman (not Docker)
;; - ABI: Idris2 | FFI: Zig | API: V-lang

;; === LANGUAGE MAP ===
;; Rust    → bivouac/src/, mandible/crates/*/src/ (systems, CLI, sensors)
;; TOML    → Cargo.toml, playbooks/ (configuration)
;; Cap'n Proto → call/ (zero-copy binary serialisation)
;; WIT     → wit/ (WebAssembly Component Model interfaces)
;; Bash    → justfile recipes, scripts (automation only)

;; === ATTESTATION ===
;; This manifest was last verified on 2026-03-16.
;; Verification: 17/17 standard workflows present, 0 banned patterns detected.
